## held, on camp
   ✔ ahbode.prep.VENDOR_KEY — the rack hands over a value

## empty, inside a boot that places keys next
   🌙 ahbode.prep.VENDOR_KEY — not yet placed; the boot places it next and reads it back

## empty, on camp, outside a boot
   ✋ ConstraintError: ahbode.prep.VENDOR_KEY — the rack hands over an EMPTY value
      ⇒ this key is REQUIRED: every ahbode prep suite on this box dies without it
      ⇒ profile 'ambient' = this box's ambient account
      ⇒ EMPTY collapses five states, and each wants a different repair:
         · this seat's $HOME holds no manifest entry for the slug
         · the session lapsed
         · this box cannot read that vault
         · an aws.params value was written into a DIFFERENT account
         · the key is an EPHEMERAL mech, so `get` hands back a minted
           token rather than the stored blob — and a replica placed
           from that is a corpse. ⚠️ do NOT 'set it here': this box is
           a grove, and a tty on the provision path is a blocker.
           the repair is CENTRAL, run once on a human's own laptop —
             rhx keyrack set --owner ehmpath --key VENDOR_KEY \
               --org ahbode --env prep --vault aws.params
           thereafter every grove reads the blob and mints its own
           token, with no prompt on any box
      ⇒ read the rack before you write to it — a set OVERWRITES:
         rhx keyrack list --owner ehmpath
         rhx keyrack unlock --owner ehmpath --env prep

## empty, off camp (a laptop)
   ✋ ConstraintError: ahbode.prep.VENDOR_KEY — the rack hands over an EMPTY value
      ⇒ this key is REQUIRED: every ahbode prep suite on this box dies without it
      ⇒ 'local@unix' is not a camp grove, so this key lives in os.secure
      ⇒ EMPTY here means one of three:
         · the session lapsed
         · this seat's $HOME holds no entry for the slug
         · an entry points at aws.params, which this box cannot read
      ⇒ read the rack before you write to it — a set OVERWRITES:
         rhx keyrack list --owner ehmpath
         rhx keyrack unlock --owner ehmpath --env prep
      ⇒ absent, or wired to aws.params? place it here, at a terminal, in os.secure:
         rhx keyrack set --owner ehmpath --key VENDOR_KEY --org ahbode --env prep --vault os.secure
      🛑 never --vault aws.params on this box (rule.require.aws-params-on-camp-groves-only)

